    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Funds raised from selling this game will be spent on saving lives of our little friends.</strong> <br><i>Every cat found in-game contributes to helping a real one in need.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find Meow in Wild West</strong> is a cozy hidden object game where you explore a hand-drawn Wild West to find <strong>100 charming cats</strong>, each one carefully hidden and full of personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax, explore at your own pace, and enjoy a peaceful journey filled with lovely meows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc31 <strong>100 unique cats</strong> to find \u2014 each one hand-placed with love</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Custom color painting</strong> \u2014 choose your favorite color to mark found cats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Relaxing soundtrack</strong> \u2014 gentle background music to accompany your exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Large hand-drawn map</strong> \u2014 explore every corner to uncover all hidden cats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca1 <strong>Hint system</strong> \u2014 a hint button appears once you find 90 cats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Achievements support</strong> \u2014 track your progress and unlock Steam achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcbe <strong>Progress saving</strong> \u2014 continue your journey anytime</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 <strong>Replay-friendly</strong> \u2014 reset and enjoy again anytime</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddb1\ufe0f <strong>Simple point-and-click controls</strong> \u2014 intuitive and accessible for everyone</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Funds raised from selling this game will be spent on saving lives of our little friends.</strong> <br><i>Every cat found in-game contributes to helping a real one in need.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find Meow in Wild West</strong> is a cozy hidden object game where you explore a hand-drawn Wild West to find <strong>100 charming cats</strong>, each one carefully hidden and full of personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax, explore at your own pace, and enjoy a peaceful journey filled with lovely meows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc31 <strong>100 unique cats</strong> to find \u2014 each one hand-placed with love</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Custom color painting</strong> \u2014 choose your favorite color to mark found cats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Relaxing soundtrack</strong> \u2014 gentle background music to accompany your exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Large hand-drawn map</strong> \u2014 explore every corner to uncover all hidden cats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca1 <strong>Hint system</strong> \u2014 a hint button appears once you find 90 cats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Achievements support</strong> \u2014 track your progress and unlock Steam achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcbe <strong>Progress saving</strong> \u2014 continue your journey anytime</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 <strong>Replay-friendly</strong> \u2014 reset and enjoy again anytime</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddb1\ufe0f <strong>Simple point-and-click controls</strong> \u2014 intuitive and accessible for everyone</p>",
